  "Question": "What is the \\(1992\\)nd letter in this sequence?\n\nABCDEDCBAABCDEDCBAABCDEDCBAABCDEDC\\(\\cdots\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(A\\)",
